SUMMARY:🕯️ David Ben-Gurion Yahrzeit reminder
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Jerusalem:20270214T163000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Jerusalem:20270214T163000
UID:reminder-20270214-308720c8-1
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering David Ben-Gurion\, whose 16th 
 Yahrzeit occurs on Monday\, February 15\, corresponding to the 8th of Adar
  I\, 5787.\n\nDavid Ben-Gurion’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Sunday\, 
 February 14 and continues until sundown on the day of observance. It is cu
 stomary to light a memorial candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay 
 your loved one’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may th
 eir memory serve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
GEO:31.76904;35.21633
